Package: catIV
Title: Instrumental Variable Analysis with a Categorical Treatment
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Amir Aamodt", "Kazemi", email = "amirhosk@uio.no",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Identification and estimation of local average treatment effects
    and conditional average treatment effects when an ordinal instrument
    affects the choice of a categorical treatment. Implements the adherence
    set framework and the categorical monotonicity assumption, the resulting
    identification of local average treatment responses and effects, target
    trial style descriptions of the identified populations, and estimators
    that combine instrumental and covariate information for heterogeneous
    treatment effects.
URL: https://github.com/kazemia/catIV, https://kazemia.github.io/catIV/
BugReports: https://github.com/kazemia/catIV/issues
